    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9c991876-ebda-5ae9-97e2-83fe985af8de",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $A+(B-C)$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -7 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n| $A+(B-C)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -7 & -4\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-9-3 & -1-6 \\\\ 8-(-7) & 6-(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & -7 \\\\ 15 & 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+(-12) & 8+(-7) \\\\ 1+15 & -4+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 & 1 \\\\ 16 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
