      ":question/id": "4e297d08-c73b-5da7-ac60-e5e29dd42108",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $R+(S-T)$, where\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -8 & -7\\end{bmatrix},\\,S=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -6\\end{bmatrix},\\,T=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n| $R+(S-T)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R+(S-T) & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -8 & -7\\end{bmatrix}+(\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -5 \\\\ -1 & -6\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -8 & -7\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}5-2 & -5-(-3) \\\\ -1-0 & -6-(-2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 \\\\ -8 & -7\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4+3 & 1+(-2) \\\\ -8+(-1) & -7+(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -1 \\\\ -9 & -11\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
