    "question": {
      ":question/id": "5b81912b-3117-5009-9fd9-4306212db501",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -5 \\\\ -8 & -4\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 6 \\\\ -8 & 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ -8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n| $A-(B-C)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -5 \\\\ -8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 6 \\\\ -8 & 7\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ -8 & 6\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -5 \\\\ -8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-8-(-2) & 6-(-2) \\\\ -8-(-8) & 7-6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -5 \\\\ -8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7-(-6) & -5-8 \\\\ -8-0 & -4-1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -13 \\\\ -8 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
